        <PCI_FLAG>0</PCI_FLAG>
        <DIAGNOSIS><![CDATA[TLS cipher suite  TLS_FALLBACK_SCSV is a signaling cipher suite value (SCSV).

TLS servers support TLS_FALLBACK_SCSV will prevent downgrade attack.]]></DIAGNOSIS>
        <CONSEQUENCE><![CDATA[N/A]]></CONSEQUENCE>
