Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 5742	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 6670	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 68	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 2140	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 555	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 1039	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 67	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 2049	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=3)	UDP Port 80	Port Unreachable
Unreachable (type=3 code=2)	IP with High Protocol	Protocol Unreachable]]></RESULT>
