        <TITLE><![CDATA[Allaire Spectra Admin Utility Accessible]]></TITLE>
        <LAST_UPDATE><![CDATA[2009-06-17T00:20:33Z]]></LAST_UPDATE>
        <PCI_FLAG>1</PCI_FLAG>
        <CVE_ID_LIST>
          <CVE_ID>
            <ID><![CDATA[CVE-2000-0862]]></ID>
            <URL><![CDATA[http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2000-0862]]></URL>
          </CVE_ID>
        </CVE_ID_LIST>
        <DIAGNOSIS><![CDATA[Allaire Spectra includes an administrative-level utility for configuring Spectra applications. 
<P>
The /allaire/spectra/system/admin/ directory contains unnecessary files for administering and configuring Allaire Spectra. These files are accessible via browsers and were inadvertently installed.]]></DIAGNOSIS>
        <CONSEQUENCE><![CDATA[Unauthorized users could exploit these files to damage or alter server data.]]></CONSEQUENCE>
        <SOLUTION><![CDATA[Remove the /allaire/spectra/system/admin/ directory from all Spectra servers. This directory is not necessary and was only used in Beta Version 1.0.1.]]></SOLUTION>
