accessible to external networks, and should be firewalled.]]></SOLUTION>
        <RESULT format="table"><![CDATA[Name	Service	NetBIOS Suffix
MACBOOKPRO-7511	Workstation Service	0x0]]></RESULT>
      </SERVICE>
