        <SOLUTION><![CDATA[Do not disclose sensitive information through the telnet banner. Use an encrypted remote session service if available. You might also put a legal advisory on the telnet banner stating:
<BR>1. Only authorized persons can connect.
<BR>2. All attack attempts will be prosecuted.
<BR>3. All connections are logged.]]></SOLUTION>
